msgstr "el dispositivo de entrada {device} no admite {rate} Hz: {error}"

msgid "output device {device} does not support {rate} Hz: {error}"
msgstr "el dispositivo de salida {device} no admite {rate} Hz: {error}"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"WASAPI: shared mode goes through the Windows audio engine and accepts on"
"ly the device's Default Format rate; exclusive mode (--wasapi-exclusive)"
" bypasses the engine at a rate the hardware supports"
msgstr ""
"WASAPI: el modo compartido pasa por el motor de audio de Windows y solo "
"acepta la frecuencia Default Format del dispositivo; el modo exclusivo ("
"--wasapi-exclusive) omite el motor a una frecuencia que el hardware admi"
"te"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"WDM kernel streaming: bypasses the Windows mixer; the device must suppor"
"t the rate"
msgstr ""
"WDM kernel streaming: omite el mezclador de Windows; el dispositivo debe"
" admitir la frecuencia"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "ASIO: direct driver path (not included in RoomScope's desktop bundles)"
msgstr ""
"ASIO: camino directo del controlador (no incluido en los paquetes de esc"
"ritorio de RoomScope)"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"DirectSound: deprecated, runs on the Windows audio engine; resamples and"
" mixes, and PortAudio does not check its rates (all look accepted); pref"
"er WASAPI"
msgstr ""
"DirectSound: obsoleto, corre sobre el motor de audio de Windows; remuest"
"rea y mezcla, y PortAudio no comprueba sus frecuencias (todas parecen ac"
"eptadas); se prefiere WASAPI"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"MME: legacy path through the Windows audio engine; resamples and mixes, "
"truncates device names; prefer WASAPI"
msgstr ""
"MME: camino heredado a través del motor de audio de Windows; remuestrea "
"y mezcla, recorta los nombres de dispositivo; se prefiere WASAPI"

msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid ""
"Core Audio: the device runs at its nominal rate (Audio MIDI Setup) and P"
